# 🍕 Food Ordering Platform — Complete Planning Document
### (Zomato / Swiggy Style — 4-Portal Architecture)

---

## Overview

A full-stack food ordering ecosystem consisting of **4 separate web applications** sharing a **single unified backend**:

| Portal | Users | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| 🛒 **Customer App** | End customers | Browse restaurants, order food, track delivery |
| 🚴 **Delivery Partner App** | Delivery agents | Accept orders, navigate to pickup/drop, earn money |
| 🍽️ **Restaurant App** | Restaurant owners/staff | Manage menu, accept/reject orders, track revenue |
| 🛠️ **Management Dashboard** | Admin/Ops team | Platform-wide analytics, user management, disputes |

---

## 🧱 Tech Stack

### Frontend (All 4 Portals)
| Layer | Technology | Reason |
|---|---|---|
| Framework | **React.js (Vite)** | Fast builds, component reuse across portals |
| Styling | **Tailwind CSS** | Rapid UI, consistent design system |
| State Management | **Zustand** | Lightweight, simpler than Redux |
| Real-time Updates | **Socket.io Client** | Live order tracking, delivery location |
| Maps | **Google Maps API / Leaflet.js** | Delivery tracking, restaurant locator |
| HTTP Client | **Axios** | API calls |
| Charts (Admin) | **Recharts** | Revenue/analytics graphs |
| Auth UI | **JWT + HttpOnly Cookies** | Secure token storage |
| 📸 Seal Comparison | **Browser Camera API + Canvas** | Capture & display seal photos side-by-side |

### Backend (Single Unified API)
| Layer | Technology | Reason |
|---|---|---|
| Runtime | **Node.js** | JS everywhere, large ecosystem |
| Framework | **Express.js** | Lightweight, flexible REST API |
| Real-time | **Socket.io** | Live order and location streaming |
| Database | **PostgreSQL** | Relational data (orders, users, menus) |
| ORM | **Prisma** | Type-safe DB queries, easy migrations |
| Cache | **Redis** | Session cache, fast restaurant searches |
| File Storage | **Cloudinary** | Restaurant/food images + seal photos |
| Email | **Nodemailer + SendGrid** | Order confirmations, OTPs |
| SMS/OTP | **Twilio** | Phone verification, delivery alerts |
| Payments | **Razorpay** | Indian payment gateway (UPI, cards, wallets) |
| Auth | **JWT + bcrypt** | Token-based auth, password hashing |

### Infrastructure & DevOps
| Tool | Purpose |
|---|---|
| **Docker + Docker Compose** | Containerize all services |
| **Nginx** | Reverse proxy, serve all 4 frontends |
| **GitHub Actions** | CI/CD pipeline |
| **AWS EC2 / Railway** | Backend hosting |
| **Vercel / Netlify** | Frontend hosting (all 4 apps) |
| **PostgreSQL (Supabase/RDS)** | Managed DB hosting |

### Project Structure (Monorepo)
```
food-platform/
├── apps/
│   ├── customer/          # React app — Customer portal
│   ├── delivery/          # React app — Delivery Partner portal
│   ├── restaurant/        # React app — Restaurant portal
│   └── admin/             # React app — Management Dashboard
├── backend/               # Node.js + Express unified API
│   ├── src/
│   │   ├── routes/
│   │   ├── controllers/
│   │   ├── middlewares/
│   │   ├── services/
│   │   ├── sockets/
│   │   └── utils/
│   └── prisma/            # DB schema & migrations
└── shared/                # Shared types, constants, utilities
```

---

## 🗄️ Database Schema (Key Tables)

```
Users (id, name, email, phone, role[customer|delivery|restaurant|admin], password_hash, created_at)

Restaurants (id, owner_id→Users, name, address, lat, lng, cuisine_type, rating, is_open, image_url)

MenuItems (id, restaurant_id→Restaurants, name, description, price, category, image_url, is_available)

Orders (id, customer_id→Users, restaurant_id→Restaurants, delivery_partner_id→Users, status[placed|confirmed|preparing|picked_up|delivered|cancelled], total_amount, payment_status, address, created_at)

OrderItems (id, order_id→Orders, menu_item_id→MenuItems, quantity, unit_price)

DeliveryTracking (id, order_id→Orders, lat, lng, updated_at)

Payments (id, order_id→Orders, razorpay_payment_id, amount, method, status)

Reviews (id, customer_id→Users, restaurant_id→Restaurants, order_id→Orders, rating, comment)

Notifications (id, user_id→Users, type, message, is_read, created_at)

-- 🔒 SEAL VERIFICATION FEATURE --
SealVerification (
  id,
  order_id             → Orders,
  dispatch_photo_url   STRING,   -- Photo taken by restaurant at dispatch
  pickup_photo_url     STRING,   -- Photo taken by delivery partner at pickup
  customer_photo_url   STRING,   -- Photo taken by customer on receipt
  customer_verdict     ENUM[intact|suspicious|tampered],  -- Chosen by customer manually
  dispute_raised       BOOLEAN,
  created_at
)
```

---

## 🌐 API Structure

All portals consume a single backend at `api.yourplatform.com`

```
Authentication
  POST   /api/auth/register          — Register any user type
  POST   /api/auth/login             — Login
  POST   /api/auth/verify-otp        — OTP verification
  POST   /api/auth/refresh           — Refresh JWT

Customer
  GET    /api/restaurants            — List restaurants (filters, search)
  GET    /api/restaurants/:id/menu   — Get full menu
  POST   /api/orders                 — Place new order
  GET    /api/orders/:id             — Order details + live status
  POST   /api/orders/:id/review      — Submit review

Restaurant
  GET    /api/restaurant/orders      — Incoming orders
  PATCH  /api/restaurant/orders/:id  — Accept/Reject/Update order
  CRUD   /api/restaurant/menu        — Manage menu items
  GET    /api/restaurant/analytics   — Revenue, popular items

Delivery Partner
  GET    /api/delivery/available-orders       — Orders to accept
  POST   /api/delivery/orders/:id/accept      — Accept order
  PATCH  /api/delivery/orders/:id/status      — Update delivery status
  POST   /api/delivery/location               — Push live GPS location
  POST   /api/delivery/orders/:id/seal-pickup — Upload pickup seal photo

Seal Verification (🔒 Unique Feature)
  POST   /api/seal/:order_id/dispatch    — Restaurant uploads dispatch photo
  POST   /api/seal/:order_id/pickup      — Delivery partner uploads pickup photo
  POST   /api/seal/:order_id/delivery    — Delivery partner uploads pre-handoff photo
  POST   /api/seal/:order_id/customer    — Customer uploads received photo
  GET    /api/seal/:order_id/compare     — Returns side-by-side photos + AI tamper score
  POST   /api/seal/:order_id/dispute     — Customer raises tamper dispute

Admin/Management
  GET    /api/admin/users            — All users (filter by role)
  PATCH  /api/admin/users/:id        — Block/unblock/verify
  GET    /api/admin/orders           — All platform orders
  GET    /api/admin/analytics        — Revenue, GMV, user growth
  GET    /api/admin/disputes         — Complaint management
```

---

## ⚡ Real-Time Features (Socket.io)

```
Events flow:
  Customer places order        →  [ORDER_PLACED]       server emits to Restaurant
  Restaurant confirms order    →  [ORDER_CONFIRMED]    server emits to Customer
  Delivery partner accepts     →  [PARTNER_ASSIGNED]   server emits to Customer + Restaurant
  Delivery partner moves       →  [LOCATION_UPDATE]    server emits to Customer (live map)
  Order delivered              →  [ORDER_DELIVERED]    server emits to all parties

  🔒 Seal Verification Events:
  Restaurant uploads photo     →  [SEAL_DISPATCHED]    server emits to Admin (audit log)
  Delivery picks up order      →  [SEAL_PICKUP_PHOTO]  server emits to Admin
  Customer marks verdict       →  [SEAL_VERDICT]       server emits to Admin for record
  Customer raises dispute      →  [SEAL_DISPUTE]       server emits to Admin for review
```

---

## 🔐 Authentication & Roles

- JWT-based authentication (`access_token` + `refresh_token`)
- Roles: `customer`, `delivery_partner`, `restaurant_owner`, `admin`
- Role-based middleware protects each route group
- Phone OTP for customer & delivery partner sign-up
- Email + password for restaurant owners & admins

---

## 📱 Portal Feature Breakdown

### 🛒 Customer Portal
- **Home**: Nearby restaurants, cuisine filters, search
- **Restaurant Page**: Menu with categories, add to cart
- **Cart**: Summary, apply coupon, choose address
- **Checkout**: Razorpay payment integration
- **Live Tracking**: Real-time map with delivery partner location
- **Order History**: Past orders, reorder option
- **Profile**: Saved addresses, payment methods
- **🔒 Seal Verification Screen** *(Unique Feature)*:
  - On delivery, prompted to take a photo of the received container
  - **Side-by-side view**: restaurant's dispatch photo vs. customer's received photo
  - Customer decides themselves: ✅ Intact / ⚠️ Suspicious / ❌ Tampered
  - One-tap button to raise a dispute with both photos as evidence

### 🚴 Delivery Partner Portal
- **Dashboard**: Available orders nearby (on map)
- **Order Accept/Decline**: With time window
- **Navigation**: Google Maps link to pickup/dropoff
- **Status Updates**: Reached restaurant, picked up, delivered
- **Earnings**: Daily/weekly earnings summary
- **Profile**: Documents upload (license, ID)
- **🔒 Seal Checkpoint** *(Unique Feature)*:
  - At restaurant pickup: prompted to photograph the sealed package
  - This creates a **chain of custody** record
  - Protects the delivery partner if customer falsely claims tampering

### 🍽️ Restaurant Portal
- **Dashboard**: Incoming orders (live audio alert)
- **Order Management**: Accept/Prepare/Ready queue
- **Menu Management**: Add/edit/delete items, mark unavailable
- **Analytics**: Revenue charts, popular items, order trends
- **Profile**: Restaurant info, hours, images
- **🔒 Dispatch Photo Capture** *(Unique Feature)*:
  - When marking order as "Ready for Pickup", mandatory camera prompt
  - Staff photographs the **sealed/packed container** before handing to rider
  - Photo is timestamped and stored against the order ID
  - Protects restaurant from false tampering complaints

### 🛠️ Management Dashboard
- **User Management**: View, verify, block delivery/restaurant users
- **Order Oversight**: All platform orders with filters
- **Analytics**: GMV, active users, delivery time, revenue splits
- **Promotions**: Create discount codes, featured restaurants
- **Dispute Resolution**: Customer complaints, refund management
- **System Health**: API status, error logs, notification sending
- **🔒 Seal Audit Panel** *(Unique Feature)*:
  - View all orders with seal photos in a grid
  - Filter by AI tamper score threshold (e.g., score > 0.7)
  - Review and resolve seal-related disputes
  - Track which restaurants/riders have highest dispute rates

