## 🗺️ Development Roadmap (Phase-Wise)

### Phase 1 — Foundation (Weeks 1–3)
- [ ] Setup monorepo with all 4 Vite/React apps
- [ ] Setup Node.js + Express backend
- [ ] Configure PostgreSQL + Prisma schema
- [ ] Implement JWT authentication for all roles
- [ ] Build basic Customer Portal (home, restaurant list, menu view)

### Phase 2 — Core Ordering Flow (Weeks 4–6)
- [ ] Cart + checkout flow (Customer)
- [ ] Razorpay payment integration
- [ ] Order placement → Restaurant notification (real-time)
- [ ] Restaurant order accept/reject (Restaurant Portal)
- [ ] Delivery order assignment (Delivery Portal)

### Phase 3 — Real-Time & Tracking (Weeks 7–9)
- [ ] Socket.io live order status updates
- [ ] Delivery partner GPS location streaming
- [ ] Live tracking map in Customer Portal
- [ ] Push notifications (browser + SMS via Twilio)

### Phase 3.5 — 🔒 Seal Verification Feature (Weeks 9–10)
- [ ] Restaurant portal: camera capture on "Ready for Pickup" action
- [ ] Delivery portal: camera capture at pickup (chain of custody)
- [ ] Cloudinary integration to store seal photos securely
- [ ] Customer portal: photo capture on delivery + manual side-by-side comparison UI
- [ ] Customer verdict selection (Intact / Suspicious / Tampered)
- [ ] Socket.io events: SEAL_DISPATCHED, SEAL_VERDICT, SEAL_DISPUTE
- [ ] Admin Seal Audit Panel with dispute resolution workflow

### Phase 4 — Management & Analytics (Weeks 10–11)
- [ ] Admin dashboard analytics charts
- [ ] User management (block/verify/approve restaurants)
- [ ] Dispute + refund management
- [ ] Revenue & GMV reporting

### Phase 5 — Polish & Deploy (Weeks 12–13)
- [ ] UI/UX refinement on all 4 portals
- [ ] Performance optimization (Redis caching, lazy loading)
- [ ] Docker containerization
- [ ] CI/CD pipeline (GitHub Actions)
- [ ] Deploy backend (AWS EC2 or Railway)
- [ ] Deploy frontends (Vercel — separate project per portal)

---

## ✅ Verification Plan

| Area | Method |
|---|---|
| Auth flows | Jest unit tests on auth controllers |
| API routes | Supertest integration tests |
| Real-time | Manual multi-tab Socket.io test |
| Payments | Razorpay test mode end-to-end |
| Live tracking | Two browser tabs (partner + customer) |
| Admin analytics | Seed test data, verify chart values |
| Deployment | Docker Compose local run before cloud push |
| 🔒 Seal photo upload | End-to-end test: restaurant → delivery → customer photo chain |
| 🔒 Manual comparison UI | Verify side-by-side layout is clear and verdict buttons work |
| 🔒 Dispute flow | Simulate customer dispute → admin review → resolution |

---

## 💡 Additional Recommendations

- **Multi-language**: Add i18n support (Hindi + English) for wider reach
- **Dark Mode**: Offer in Customer app for nighttime ordering UX
- **PWA**: Make Customer app a Progressive Web App for mobile installs
- **Rate Limiting**: Use `express-rate-limit` to prevent API abuse
- **CORS**: Whitelist only the 4 frontend domains
- **Logging**: Use `Winston` + `Morgan` for structured API logs
- **Error Monitoring**: Integrate `Sentry` for crash tracking

